OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F391A1786643328
OL,3,CSearch for youth after officer hit by
OL,4,Cstolen car
OL,6,FPolice investigating an incident in
OL,7,Fwhich an officer was hit by a car have
OL,8,Freleased images of a person they want
OL,9,Fto find.
OL,11,FThe young man was pictured in the area
OL,12,Fwhen the officer was injured on
OL,13,FWednesday morning.
OL,15,FNorthumbria Police said the officer,
OL,16,Fwho works for Durham Constabulary, was
OL,17,Fcarrying out inquiries following a
OL,18,Fburglary in the Burdon area of
OL,19,FSunderland when he was hit by a stolen
OL,20,Fcar in Cooperative Terrace at about
OL,21,F8.30am.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/3
