FL,392,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F391A1786643328
OL,3,CSearch for youth after officer hit by
OL,4,Cstolen car
OL,6,FThe car, which had been driven into
OL,7,Fthe Durham force's area, also hit a
OL,8,Fparked car.
OL,10,FSix boys, aged between 13 and 17, were
OL,11,Farrested in connection with the
OL,12,Fincident, and have since been released
OL,13,Fon bail pending further enquiries.
OL,15,FThe officer has been discharged from
OL,16,Fhospital.
OL,18,FDet Ch Insp Rebecca Fenney, of
OL,19,FNorthumbria Police, said: "Thank you
OL,20,Fto everyone who has so far provided
OL,21,Finformation towards our investigation.
