OL,3,CSearch for youth after officer hit by
OL,4,Cstolen car
OL,6,F"We have carried out a number of lines
OL,7,Fof enquiry already and would ask that
OL,8,Fanyone with further details please get
OL,9,Fin touch so that we can piece together
OL,10,Fexactly what took place."
